    "title": "Inola deals with smelter opposition - NewsBreak",
    "text": "9 hours ago City council members in Inola have delayed consideration of the creation of a new city committee to review industrial development in the city. It’s an idea born out of the $4 billion proposed aluminum smelter at the Port of Inola, a project that has drawn opposition from those who contend the project would be environmentally harmful to the region. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
